@dc:title "Review Gate Model Bundle"
@dc:description "The shared elements plus both deployment descriptions, closed under the method bundle."
description bundle <https://hongyan.github.io/review-gate/model/bundle#> as d-bundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <https://hongyan.github.io/review-gate/method/bundle#>
    includes <https://hongyan.github.io/review-gate/model/common#>
    includes <https://hongyan.github.io/review-gate/model/code-review#>
    includes <https://hongyan.github.io/review-gate/model/grading#>
}
